- [Create an auto-approval policy for just-in-time node access](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/systems-manager-just-in-time-node-access-create-auto-approval-policies.md): Learn how to configure automatic approval rules for just-in-time node access based on conditions.
- [Create a deny-access policy for just-in-time node access](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/systems-manager-just-in-time-node-access-create-deny-access-policies.md): Learn how to create policies that automatically deny specific just-in-time access requests.
- [Create approval policies for just-in-time node access with Amazon Q](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/systems-manager-just-in-time-node-access-create-approval-policies-q-ide-cli.md): Learn how to configure approval policies using Amazon Q for just-in-time node access management.
