- [Update a Windows Server AMI](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/automation-tutorial-update-patch-windows-ami.md): Automate image maintenance tasks on your Amazon Windows AMI without authoring the runbook in JSON or YAML.
