- [Reset passwords and SSH keys on EC2 instances](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/automation-ec2reset.md): Use the AWSSupport-ResetAccess runbook to re-enable local Administrator passwords and to generate new SSH keys.
