### [Parameter Store](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/systems-manager-parameter-store.md)

Learn how Parameter Store provides secure, hierarchical storage for configuration data and lightweight secrets management.

- [Getting started with Parameter Store](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/parameter-store-how-to-retrieve.md): In this tutorial, you learn how to create, retrieve, update, and delete Parameter Store parameters by using the AWS CLI.

