- [Setting the Parameter Store default tier using the console, AWS CLI, or PowerShell](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/parameter-store-tier-changing.md): By default, Parameter Store sets the default setting to the standard parameter tier.
- [Changing a standard parameter to an advanced parameter](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/parameter-store-advanced-parameters-enabling.md): Use the following procedure to change an existing standard parameter to an advanced parameter.
