- [Setting up notifications or triggering actions based on Parameter Store events](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/sysman-paramstore-cwe.md): Learn how to use EventBridge and Amazon SNS to notify you about changes to parameters in Parameter Store.

