- [Using native parameter support for Amazon Machine Image IDs](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/parameter-store-ec2-aliases.md): Learn how to use parameters in Parameter Store with data type aws:ec2:image in your templates, commands, and scripts.
- [Deleting parameters](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/deleting-parameters.md): Learn how to delete a parameter in Parameter Store.

