- [Calling AMI public parameters](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/parameter-store-public-parameters-ami.md): Learn how to call AMI public parameters in Parameter Store, a tool in AWS Systems Manager, for Amazon Linux 2, Amazon Linux 2023, macOS, and Windows Server.
