- [Debian Server](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/agent-install-deb.md): Connect to a Debian Server instance and install SSM Agent on each instance that will run commands using Systems Manager.
- [Oracle Linux](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/agent-install-oracle.md): Connect to an Oracle Linux instance and install SSM Agent on each instance that will run commands using Systems Manager.

